    "title": "C Programming - Web Server",
    "description": "Constructed a simple web server using C programming language.\n\n• Wrote HTTP request parser and response builder functions to provide RESTful API responses.\n\n• Implemented a LRU cache to store data within memory, using a doubly-linked list along with a hash table data structure.\n",
